# Line endings are decided here rather than by each clone's `core.autocrlf`.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every file on disk on the way in
# and out, and any tool that touches a file — Prettier, an editor, a script —
# leaves git reporting the whole tree as modified when the content has not
# changed. Every file in this repository is LF; pinning it keeps a diff about
# the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary by nature: never converted, never diffed as text. None are tracked
# today, but these are what an email builder's fixtures and docs attract.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

# Generated, and noisy in a review. Still diffable on request with `--text`.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
